<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Shared Medical cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Shared Medical cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it lowered its near-term rating on Shared Medical Systems Corp to neutral from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Kept long-term accumulate rating.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1-7/8 to 40-1/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
